{"Async functions deleteScheduledEmailReminder and deleteScheduledSMSReminder are called inside forEach without await, creating fire-and-forget promises where the wrapping try/catch cannot catch promise rejections, making the error handler unreachable for async failures": 0.8890615701675415, "immediateDelete branch in deleteScheduledEmailReminder cancels email via SendGrid but returns without deleting the WorkflowReminder record or setting cancelled: true, causing orphaned database records that accumulate permanently": 0.9425469040870667, "Single try/catch wrapping the entire for...of loop for cancelling reminders means if SendGrid API fails for any reminder, the loop aborts and skips all remaining reminders AND the Promise.all that deletes already-processed reminders, causing duplicate cancel requests and permanently blocking cleanup": 0.9451179504394531}